          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor correctly identifies the case as an incisional hernia with planned laparoscopic repair under general anaesthesia and frames it as a preoperative transition.",
          "quote": "您说的这个情况我大致理解了——之前做过肠梗阻手术，现在原切口附近鼓了一个包，医生考虑是切口疝，准备做腹腔镜修补，手术要全麻。"
